[gd_scene load_steps=5 format=3 uid="uid://b0proj0rocketp1"]

; The PLAYER's rocket (GRK-X Devastator). Identical ordnance to
; projectile_rocket.tscn, which is the MECH/COLOSSUS/TITAN round — but that one
; sits on layer 5 "enemy_projectile" and masks world+player, so it cannot
; collide with a robot at all. Fired by the player it flew straight THROUGH its
; target and only ever hurt anything by splashing off whatever geometry was
; behind. Aimed at a lone robot in the open it did nothing.
;
; This one is layer 4 "player_projectile", masks world+enemy, and leaves
; direct_damage off — _splash() already folds the direct `damage` into the blast
; (see Projectile._splash), so enabling it here would double-dip.

